OL,3,GNEWSACity wedding venue fails to
OL,4,Aoverturn ban on holding events
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Glasgow wedding venue which held
OL,7,Fevents for three years without having
OL,8,Fplanning permission has failed in an
OL,9,Fattempt to secure approval
OL,10,Fretrospectively.
OL,12,FThe Haberdashery, on Sauchiehall
OL,13,FStreet, had been granted permission to
OL,14,Foperate as a restaurant between noon
OL,15,Fand 23:00 seven days a week.
OL,17,FBut it had also been used as a
OL,18,Ffunctions and event space since 2022
OL,19,Fwithout consent.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
